// xfail: E232
// test_local_float_promo_neg.bpp — the T2 promotion's conservative edge.
// A bare local whose ADDRESS escapes must NOT be silently retyped: the
// pointer's holder may read or write raw bytes, and changing the slot's
// meaning behind its back is exactly the silent-reinterpretation class the
// typing doctrine forbids. With promotion refused, the original E232
// ("annotate or refuse") stays in force — the programmer decides.
main() {
    auto x;
    x = 1.5;
    poke(&x, 3);
    return 0;
}
